{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07129","headline":"廨中见桃花南枝已开北枝未发因寄杜副端 · 刘长卿","name":"廨中见桃花南枝已开北枝未发因寄杜副端","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何意同根本，开花每後时。\n应缘去日远，独自发春迟。\n结实恩难忘，无言恨岂知。\n年光不可待，空羡向南枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}